+/*
+ * Node set functions for Mini-XML, a small XML file parsing library.
+ *
+ * Copyright 2003-2017 by Michael R Sweet.
+ * Copyright (C) 2019 XiaoMi, Inc.
+ *
+ * These coded instructions, statements, and computer programs are the
